<BaseLayout eligible={true} title="Editorial policy" description="Pre-launch editorial standards for Rule & Ratio.">
<h1>Editorial policy</h1>
<div class="prose">
<p>Our planned publishing standard prioritizes primary sources, verifiable legal citations, accurate jurisdiction and dates, and substantive human review before publication.</p>
<p>Judgments must be checked against official or reliably authenticated texts. Articles must distinguish holdings from commentary, identify relevant amendments and avoid misrepresenting the status of law.</p>
<p>We will respect privacy, confidentiality, applicable reporting restrictions and copyright. We will not publish confidential case materials or use the platform to solicit legal work.</p>
<p>Corrections and review procedures will be formalized before public launch. No claim of academic peer review, indexing or ISSN registration is made at this stage.</p>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
